===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|id=time system|:inh|enm:kalender<id:calendar>|tree=+}}
From {{inh|en|enm|kalender}}, from {{der|en|fro|calendier}}, from {{der|en|la|calendarium||account book}}, from {{m|la|kalendae||the first day of the month}}, from {{m|la|kalō||to announce solemnly, to call out (the sighting of the new moon)}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*kelh₁-}}. {{doublet|en|calendarium}}.

Displaced native {{ncog|ang|rīmbōc}} and {{m|ang|ġerīmbōc}}.

